   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>A rectangle has an area of <span data-math=\"24 cm^2\">24 cm^2</span>. Function <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> gives the length of the rectangle, in centimeters, when the width is <span data-math=\"w\">w</span> cm. Determine which values, in centimeters, are possible inputs of the function. <strong>Select three</strong> that apply.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>3</li>\n  <li>0.5</li>\n  <li>48</li>\n  <li>–6</li>\n  <li>0</li>\n</ol>",
